# Nova AI implementation roadmap

Status reflects code paths implemented in this branch. Provider-backed features, Windows-only actions, and audio behavior still require end-to-end validation on the target machine.

## Phase 1: Desktop and browser control
- [x] Open Windows applications using voice commands
- [x] Open Notepad
- [x] Open websites
- [x] Google web search through voice commands
- [x] YouTube search through voice commands
- [x] Open folders using voice commands
- [x] Create text files without overwriting existing files
- [x] Rename, move, and copy files/folders without overwriting destinations
- [x] Delete files/folders only after exact confirmation
- [x] Search and open local files
- [x] PDF text extraction and optional OCR for scanned PDFs/images

## Phase 2: System control
- [x] Lock the computer
- [x] Put the computer to sleep
- [x] Increase system volume
- [x] Decrease system volume
- [x] Mute/unmute system audio (toggle)
- [x] Restart the computer after exact confirmation
- [x] Shut down the computer after exact confirmation
