## Validation boundary

A checked box means an implementation path exists; it does not imply the feature has passed live testing. CI currently checks syntax, tool registration, and safety guards without API credentials or access to a Windows desktop. Semantic document embeddings and screen analysis require `GEMINI_API_KEY`. All local file and desktop actions run with the operating-system permissions of the process.
